Description: Aurora Mesa (x86_64) as the FEX guest graphics provider
 The x86_64 build of Aurora's Asahi Gallium, Zink and Borealis Vulkan
 drivers, from the same Mesa commit as the host's Mesa, laid over FEX's
 stock guest root filesystem as a graphics provider at
 /usr/share/guestos/aurora-fex-mesa. Without it, x86 programs run under FEX
 load a guest Mesa with no Apple G17P support and every GPU job they submit
 is rejected.
 .
 The layer is laid out for Debian and Ubuntu root filesystems. It is x86
 code for the FEX guest, not for this system; it links neither LLVM nor
 SPIRV-Tools, so it works with any guest release.
